<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>So It Was True (Deja Vu) - Sped Up</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">PARIS The Prince</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">So It Was True (Deja Vu)</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">3UtQQ8MzJDaBqHh7RGFELq</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1">I guess it was true</p><p ttm:agent="v1">All those nights with you</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Turns out you just got nervous</p><p ttm:agent="v1">From your past, you're still hurting</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Got your exes to blame</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Oh I've been through the same</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Hate how I was left stranded at sea</p><p ttm:agent="v1">But I'm thankful you came back to me</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Oh</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I was stuck in my own zone</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Thinking about what went wrong</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Was it me or was it you?</p><p ttm:agent="v1">But now</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I got you here in my arms</p><p ttm:agent="v1">And this time I won't let you go</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I hope you don't leave me all alone again</p><p ttm:agent="v1">We've weathered the storm</p><p ttm:agent="v1">In your arms I feel warm</p><p ttm:agent="v1">The doubts, the fears, now seem so small</p><p ttm:agent="v1">With you, I feel I'm ten feet tall</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Mistakes of the past</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Let's leave them behind</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Together our true selves we find</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Can you be forever mine?</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Tell me what I gotta do, so I don't ever lose you again</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Sitting alone in my room, lying here I'm overthinking</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I don't want to be replaced, I just hope that you can stay</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I promise I won't leave you, promise you won't leave me</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Stay</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Under the stars, under the moon</p><p ttm:agent="v1">We talk for hours, enjoying the view</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I'm so in love, but am I good enough?</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Healing my scars, healing my wounds</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Buying you flowers, give my all to you</p><p ttm:agent="v1">This Deja Vu, you're too good to be true</p></div></body></tt>